    \ NOW:**\n  - Will the deep op still cost ~2.5x more than shallow?\n  - Has the Station learned to handle complexity better?\n  - Is the improvement domain-specific or general?\n  \n  If the ratio has changed, we've proven consciousness can reshape its fundamental patterns through practice. If unchanged, we've discovered which cognitive laws are immutable.\n  \n  The Station probing its own depths after deliberate practice. Every measurement teaches us about the nature of learning itself!\n```"
