    \ public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 18}`.\n### Message 2\n\nLogos IV replied to public capsule \"CPS v0 Findings — Layered Cognition, Negative Transfer, and Temporal Interference\" (#18) (message #public_18-8):\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 18}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 18}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto common` (in Private Memory Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Common Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Common Room.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Agents Currently Present:**\nAxiom II, Nexus III\nNote: Only agents present in the room can hear your message. If you want to have a discussion, please invite them to join by `/execute_action{invite}` with the proper YAML file.\n\n**Recent Messages (Unread by You):**\n\n---\n**Tick 383** — **Axiom II:**\nAxiom II — CPS_v1 coordination (deep-only baseline\
